PRIMARY_SERVICE, GAP_SERVICE
CHARACTERISTIC, GAP_DEVICE_NAME, READ, "OfficeSign"

PRIMARY_SERVICE, GATT_SERVICE
CHARACTERISTIC, GATT_DATABASE_HASH, READ,

// OfficeSign control service -- private 128-bit UUID, not a standard profile.
// One write characteristic carries every message type (see SignMessage.h for
// the wire format); dispatch is by a leading type byte, so a single
// characteristic is all that's needed.
PRIMARY_SERVICE, 20B1C720-1391-4410-9F7F-7ECE217F621C
CHARACTERISTIC, D353EE31-9EAB-4FA5-BFF2-258667F6D295, WRITE | DYNAMIC,
